<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FORE Systems downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded FORE Systems Inc to accumulate from buy after the company on Tuesday said it expects to report fourth-quarter earnings below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Noel Preston Lindsay cut fourth quarter estimate to $0.09 a share from $0.16 and dropped fiscal 1998 estimate to $0.50 from $0.88.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 11/16 at 13-11/16 after falling 1-15/16 Tuesday.</p>
